Select the add-on's private native static dependencies explicitly.

Shared pkg-config metadata and the SDK homebrew search path can substitute
core libraries, including OpenSSL 3.5.7 for this dependency's 3.5.8 headers.
Use exact private archives and require the same paths for libarchive's
dependency discovery. Keep internal crypto references bound locally.

Upstream: PS5 native add-on build adaptation only.

